  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: w_2021.1.2p1\nDescription of the bug:\nSafety settings are ignored if you've already downloaded the avatar.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nI saw a few people with the \"Perf Blocked\" robot avatars because their avatars exceeded the maximum file size I've set in my safety settings. When I clicked \"Show Avatar\" on them, their avatars loaded in. But when I switched back to \"Use Safety Settings\", their avatars didn't switch back to the \"Perf Blocked\" robot.",
